#
# https://help.github.com/articles/dealing-with-line-endings/
#
# Linux start script should use lf
/gradlew        text eol=lf

# Windows script files are stored as written, with the crlf the wrapper
# task generates. Under a text rule, a bump committed without
# normalization leaves every checkout showing gradlew.bat as modified
*.bat           -text

# Binary files should be left untouched
*.jar           binary

